open Breeno Scan with the global scanner's action

The camera, from the China firmware, opens Breeno Scan with coloros.intent.action.OBJECT_SCANNER.
The global OcrScanner (16.4.7) has no activity for that action and the mode failed with
ActivityNotFoundException; its scan activity, CameraActivity, answers to
coloros.intent.action.CAMERA_SCANNER, so the camera asks for that.

